  "notes": [
    "Runtime aligned with the new supplied archive; Vercel infrastructure and Firebase configuration preserved.",
    "GERAL is the sole lead source for the four updated cities; source IDs verified against Google Sheets and public CSV on 2026-10-15.",
    "Existing contact reconciliation, failure handling, refresh and creative status behavior retained.",
    "Webinar leads, advertising and quiz now read from dedicated PRO-WEB; id_pessoa supported and city attribution recovered from tracking when blank. Existing city ticket sources retained. Verified on 2026-10-15.",
    "Workshop view removed from navigation and routing; webinar menu and page heading renamed to Teto Invisível - Webinário.",
    "Supabase integration added for the four city lead views and 24 advertising tables. Server-side secret configuration activates migration; Sheets remain available before activation. No direct raw dedup table access or database permission changes. Supplemental sources and PRO-WEB remain on Sheets. Schema and aggregate source checks performed on 2026-10-19; live REST end-to-end check requires the production server credential.",
    "Lead REST timeout corrected with bounded ID intervals and a server-only bounds RPC over the authorized city views. Original views, base tables and existing RLS/grants unchanged. Applied on 2026-10-19."
  ],
